# Context Core

- Locate, then read slices; never load folders or full logs by default.
- Tool output: errors plus final 30 lines, or one JSONL summary.
- Verify behavioral changes; report result, evidence, and `path:lines`.
- Default output: plain or Agent Wire; no recap/table/heading unless it helps.
- Never expose/commit secrets or run destructive commands without explicit approval.
- Git: inspect status/diff; no commit/push/amend/force unless requested.
- Keep canonical facts in one file; link rather than duplicate.
- Use task-specific skills under `.ade/skills/` on demand.
- Bulk AI work: use FreeLLMAPI when available — see skill `freellmapi-offload`.
